     [38;5;246mWhole repo on ESM; rename src/index.js and src/utils.js to .cjs. Adds a node:test unit test for the hostname map. [39m
     [38;5;246mNo dependencies. Touches two files outside the feature.[39m
  [38;5;246m2.[39m Name it src/settings.mjs, add node:test
